## Dependency Order

```
Phase 1  ──→  Phase 2  ──→  Phase 3  ──→  Phase 4
(UX/State)   (DuckDB/FAERS) (MGPS/Lifecycle) (Kafka/SHAP)
   │               │               │
   │               └──────────────→ MGPS.py needed by Phase 3
   │                               └──→ DuckDB needed by MGPS
   └──→ DrugContext needed by all subsequent phases
```

Phase 1 and Phase 2 can partially overlap (Phase 1 is frontend-heavy, Phase 2 is backend-heavy).
Phase 3 requires Phase 2 (`DuckDB + MGPS`).
Phase 4 requires Phase 2 (DuckDB for consumer writes) and Phase 3 (signal_cases for alert routing).

